{"id":"9ffb0a0f4e68507b","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Proper Map","display":"df-zfc-top4-proper-map — ZFC Top4 Proper Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-proper-map — ZFC Top4 Proper Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-preimage]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-proper-map — ZFC Top4 Proper Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map\">58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-preimage\">58-df-zfc-rel-preimage</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f,K,A\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f,K,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\">\\((f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"44867449c3df728b\" href=\"?note=44867449c3df728b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map\">58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K,X,\\tau_X)\">\\((K,X,\\tau_X)\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（参数顺序为“逆像、关系、目标集”，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-preimage\">58-df-zfc-rel-preimage</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}proper\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\n\\forall K\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\to\n\\exists A\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(A,f,K)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}proper\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\n\\forall K\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\to\n\\exists A\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(A,f,K)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-preimage","status":"resolved","id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-preimage]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$（参数顺序为 $(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)$，see [[58-df-zfc-top2-continuous-map]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"67cf48a2f6e27861","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3$（参数顺序为 $(K,X,\\tau_X)$，see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-preimage","status":"resolved","id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3$（参数顺序为“逆像、关系、目标集”，see [[58-df-zfc-rel-preimage]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f,K,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"(K,X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}proper\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ContinuousMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\n\\forall K\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\to\n\\exists A\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(A,f,K)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\n\\right)\n\\right)\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1347,"backlinks":[{"id":"9cc3cffe81d4e71b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8991e2677563aa6b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop4ProperMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (canonical proper-map predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3575","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map.md|58-df-zfc-top4-proper-map]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["44867449c3df728b","67cf48a2f6e27861","39c10f49239bf771"]}